x\">Problème d'équipement pendant le cathétérisme</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">T82.5</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Mechanical complication of other cardiac and vascular devices and implants</td><td>un problème d'équipement n'est pas une complication du patient</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-AE-0034</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Embolisation d'un stent</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">T82.8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other specified complications of cardiac and vascular prosthetic devices, implants and grafts</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-AE-0035</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Rupture d'un conduit ou d'un vaisseau après implantation de stent</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">T82.8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other specified complications of cardiac and vascular prosthetic devices, implants and grafts</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-AE-0036</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Compression coronaire après implantation de dispositif transluminal</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">T82.5</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Mechanical complication of other cardiac and vascular devices and implants</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-AE-0037</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Stent laissé déployé en position non prévue après migration ou embolisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">T82.5</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Mechanical complication of other cardiac and vascular devices and implants</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-AE-0039</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Embolisation (délogement) d'un coil introduit par cathéter</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">T82.8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other specified complications of cardiac and vascular prosthetic devices, implants and grafts</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-AE-0040</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Thrombose vasculaire ou de conduit post-procédurale</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">T81.7</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Vascular complications following a procedure, not elsewhere classified</td><td>corrigé v6.1 — crossmap IPCCC : T81.0 ; T81.0 désigne une hémorragie ; une thrombose est une complication vasculaire</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-AE-0041</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Hémorragie post-procédurale</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">T81.0</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Haemorrhage and haematoma complicating a procedure, not elsewhere classified</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">TAUSSIG-AE-0042</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">Anévrisme aortique post-procédural</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I71.2</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Thoracic aortic aneurysm, without mention of rupture</td><td>lésion ; le concept exige l'origine post-procédurale</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-top-style: none; border-left-width: 0px\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Y83.8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other surgical procedures</td><td>cause externe</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">TAUSSIG-AE-0043</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">Anévrisme de l'aorte au site de coarctation après intervention</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">I71.2</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Thoracic aortic aneurysm, without mention of rupture</td><td>idem</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-top-style: none; border-left-width: 0px\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact\" title=\"inexact\">maps loosely to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Y83.8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Other surgical procedures</td><td>cause externe</td></tr></table></div>"
